      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "54牛顿、81牛顿的力？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "647",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "647. 求下列方程的根的集合：",
        "а) $2^{3x}=\\frac{1}{128}$；　　б) $0.5^{3x-2}=0.125$；",
        "в) $9^x=27$；　　г) $25^{x-1}=125$；",
        "д) $36^{-x}=6\\sqrt{6}$；　　е) $(\\sqrt{7})^{3x+1}=49$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "648",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "648. 求下列不等式的解集合：",
        "а) $11^{5x}>11^6$；　　б) $\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)^{-3x}<\\frac{16}{81}$；",
        "в) $9^x<27$；　　г) $16^x>0.125$；",
        "д) $25^{4x}<5\\sqrt{5}$；　　е) $\\left(\\frac{1}{49}\\right)^{6x}>7\\sqrt[3]{49}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "649",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "649. 利用图象说明下列方程有几个根：",
        "а) $2^x=-x+3$；б) $3^x=-x^2+4$；в) $2^x=x^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "650",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "650. 下列方程有几个解？",
        "а) $(x+1)^2+y^2=0$；　　б) $x^2-10x+25+y^2=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "651",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "651. 解下列方程组：",
        "а) $\\begin{cases}x+2y+15=0,\\\\↵2x^2+y^2=219;\\end{cases}$"
      ],
      "offset_label_row": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "651",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "б) $\\begin{cases}3x+y+5=0,\\\\↵6x^2+2xy+y^2=25.\\end{cases}$"
      ],
      "offset_label_row": true
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "652",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "652. а) 证明：直线 $x-2y=75$ 和圆周 $x^2+y^2=1089$ 不相交.",
        "б) 证明：直线 $x+7y=50$ 和圆周 $x^2+y^2=50$ 相切，并",
        "求切点的坐标."
      ]
    },
